; the_catch.room - catching it in mid-fall (docs/maps/README.md), Solstice's trials region.
; Tested by tests/scenes/world/rooms/trials/the_catch_test.gd. Base movement, a single jump.
;
; Combinado 3 (design 02 section 8.4, Apanhar no Ar; user, 2026-10-07: "Desce na
; corda"): Ivo stands at the bottom of a well of earth walls. A platform hangs
; 300 px over him, out of reach; the exit opens in the right wall 160 px up,
; also out of reach. Soltar from under the platform frees its brake and it
; lowers, swinging, with no footing (design 02 section 7.1: "uma plataforma
; balancando"). Enraizar played while it is low enough to jump onto, and high
; enough to jump from to the exit, seizes it there. Enraizar first seizes it
; where it hangs; played too soon after Soltar, it seizes it too high.

[room]
origin = 0, -16

